  first | exact @GlobalTheory.HilbFam.trace_denominator_of_hasLevel | exact GlobalTheory.HilbFam.trace_denominator_of_hasLevel | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.HilbFam.trace_denominator_of_hasLevel <;> assumption)
